w hundred metres behind Williams.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":13,"text":"On lap 13 Lehoux had repaired his car at the track side.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":17,"text":"After several stops and after replacing plugs on his Maserati, De Sterlich retired on lap 17.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":18,"text":"Perrot retired his Alfa Romeo on lap 18 after an accident.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":20,"text":"After Lehoux had also retired, the field was down to 13 cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":23,"text":"Dor\u00e9 hits a balustrade; only a flat tyre results.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":30,"text":"Caracciola closes on Williams and passes him for the lead.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":34,"text":"Williams attacked Caracciola on lap 34 at the exit of the tunnel but was not able to pass.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":36,"text":"On lap 36 Williams finally succeeded to regain the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":42,"text":"Sandri's Maserati had retired on lap 42.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":47,"text":"On lap 47 Dauvergne retired his Bugatti with ignition problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":49,"text":"Williams stops to refuel (1m30s); Caracciola takes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":49,"text":"The German made a second sideslip, realizing that his tires no longer provided sufficient grip on the fresh tarred surface, which had been softened by the sun.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":51,"text":"Unfortunately for Caracciola, the handle of the hammer broke during the pitstop.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":51,"text":"Caracciola's refuelling and rear-wheel change takes 4m30s; Williams retakes the lead and Caracciola is a lap and a quarter down.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":51,"text":"Bouriano, who drove at a brisk and steady race speed, took only 1m20s for his fuel stop.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":56,"text":"Zehender retired on lap 56.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":70,"text":"After 70 laps Caracciola had regained third place. Williams was 1m52s ahead of Bouriano and 3m28s ahead of Caracciola, 5m13s ahead of Philippe, 10m47s ahead of Dreyfus","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":80,"text":"De Rovin hits the sandbags at the chicane and spins off, damaging his wheels; he is out.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":90,"text":"The classification for the first six remained the same after 90 laps","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Williams takes the chequered flag; Bouriano is second, 1m17.8s behind, and Caracciola third.","q":false,"c":0}]}